=== KMI compatibility note ===

The 5.10.255 kernel is KMI-compatible with the device's stock 5.10.237
vendor_dlkm modules because:
  1. same_magic() (module.c:1373-1381) skips the version prefix when
     has_crcs=true, comparing only the common suffix
     " SMP preempt mod_unload modversions aarch64" which is identical
     across both vermagic strings.
  2. check_version() (module.c:1348-1352) returns 1 (success) with only
     a pr_warn() message even when CRCs disagree — warn-only, never blocks.
  3. No DKLM/30 modules are installed by this zip (kernel-only); the device
     retains its stock vendor_dlkm modules on the vendor_dlkm partition.

